aes_cipher_top_6_final.def.gz and aes_cipher_top_6_final.v.gz are the routed DEF and netlist of the
ASAP7 aes design from the public OpenROAD-flow-scripts CI (job OpenROAD-flow-scripts-Public/master,
build 1817, 2026-11-21, artifact final_report_aes_asap7_base_2026-11-21_23-05.tar.gz), unchanged
apart from gzip. They are derived from the AES core below. The LEF files and the reduced Liberty file
are from ASAP7, see ../ASAP7_LICENSE.

aes_cipher_top_6_final.spef.gz holds the parasitics of the same routed design, extracted with the open-source
OpenRCX of OpenROAD (container image openroad/orfs:latest, 2026-11-23) from 6_final.odb of the same CI artifact:
define_process_corner -ext_model_index 0 X; extract_parasitics -ext_model_file
platforms/asap7/rcx_patterns.rules; write_spef -coordinates. Without -coordinates the output equals the
6_final.spef of that artifact apart from its *DATE line.

AES core: Copyright (C) 2000-2002 Rudolf Usselmann, downloaded from http://www.opencores.org/cores/aes_core/.
OpenROAD-flow-scripts distributes it under the license below (flow/designs/src/aes/LICENSE).

